      "title": "JavaScript Required",
      "description": "Discover — Bluesky Discover Feeds ✨ I 💙 Dogs @dogs100.bsky.social · 24m No contest…. 1:00 0:00 / 1:01 6 21 197 Art & Nature @capecodfairytales.bsky.social · 37m #Poetry #Painting #Morning I start the morning gently\nIn a quiet sort of way\nJust grateful for the time \nAnd another beautiful day\n\n- Sarah Sarna\n\n🎨 Kevin Kia 11 30 The Globe and Mail @theglobeandmail.com · 1h Gloria Steinem, the American writer, lecturer, activist and organizer who fought for gender equality and women’s civil and reproductive rights for more than five decades, has died, her foundation said. She was 92 years old.\n\n🔗 Read more here: bit.ly/3VbkZoE 13 109 456 Forbes @forbes.com · 3h Steinem was one of the most recognizable figures in the modern women’s movement and a longtime journalist who cofounded both New York Magazine and Ms. Magazine. Feminist Icon Gloria Steinem Dies At 92 Steinem was one of the most recognizable figures in the modern women’s movement and a longtime journalist who cofounded both New York Magazine and Ms. Magazine. www.forbes.com 102 686 2.1K Jim Musil Painter @jimmusilpainter.bsky.social · 15h My painting QUAKING ASPENS\n\nMy Labor Day Sale is on now! All prints marked down. Use code SALE20 for an additional 20% off! 7 82 532 Mychal Threets @mychal3ts.bsky.social · 41m Gloria Steinem. An unexpected life, an iconic life ✨\n\nA trailblazer. A lifelong learner, thank you for inviting me and other librarians into your home to talk literacy. It was an honor to be seated next to courage.\n\nThank you for your fight, for your fierce. Rest in Love, Gloria Steinem 🩷 ALT 1 23 232 Digital Brain @yourdigitalbrain.bsky.social · 4h This dog and cat take turns giving each other paw massages, showing that interspecies friendship can look a lot like mutual grooming. 49 379 3.1K 𝙹*𝚊𝚍𝚘𝚛𝚎 𝙼𝚊𝚐𝚛𝚒𝚝𝚝𝚎 🍏 @artmyoldfriend.bsky.social · 2h Slava Ukraini! 🌻🇺🇦\n\n\"Sunflowers. Autumn\" by Ukrainian artist Yevheniia Bozhko. ALT 7 87 599 Bruce H. McCosar @bmccosar.bsky.social · 2h Gloria Steinem has passed away. Long ago, my parents used to force me to go to church each Sunday. One time the pastor made a comment about \"people who were destroying America, like Carl Sagan and Gloria Steinem.\"\n\nI liked Carl Sagan.\n\nGloria Steinem was new to me.\n\nI took it as a recommendation. ALT 57 319 2.1K Vincent van Gogh @vangogh.bsky.social · 1h Van Gogh distrusted varnish. He left his paintings matte, which he considered closer to the natural appearance of the paint and more aligned with his artistic vision. 1 10 53 ProPublica @propublica.org · 1h NEW on “Paper Trail”: More likely than not, there are ”forever chemicals” in your blood. \n\nHere’s the thing: 3M knew that these chemicals had seeped into people’s blood for decades — and continued making them.\n\nWe found out how they kept this secret. Listen to the full episode: How the Planet-Altering Disaster of “Forever Chemicals” Was Kept Secret www.propublica.org 14 320 601 The Washington Post @washingtonpost.com · 2h Breaking news: Gloria Steinem, celebrated author and activist who became one of the most influential voices behind the women’s movement through the second half of the 20th century and into the 21st, died at her home in New York City. \n\nShe was 92. Gloria Steinem, lodestar of the modern women’s movement, dies at 92 \"In my heart, I think a woman has two choices,\" she once said. \"Either she's a feminist or a masochist.\" wapo.st 31 202 664 Politico @politico.com · 6m Mamdani has already endorsed AOC for president — sort of Mamdani has already endorsed AOC for president — sort of This spring, Mamdani quietly signed a previously unreported petition that all but endorsed the progressive lawmaker for president. dlvr.it 3 1 14 Bunsen, Beaker, Bernoulli, & Brix @bunsenbernerbmd.bsky.social · 1h Be someone’s Kevin.\n\n🎥 Puppy Bernoulli playing with a golden retriever puppy. 18 69 660 mc2 @mc2photogal.bsky.social · 14h \"There is no Lake America. Hope you can swim!\" #LakeOntario #LakeAmerica 210 1.5K 6.4K Ellie Mae O'Hagan @elliemaeohagan.bsky.social · 3h I love the dedication in My Life on the Road by Gloria Steinhem 42 983 3.7K shar @sharyap.com · 8h so i recently realized you can sketch on top of your sketch to make the sketch better and it is exploding my brain. this whole time i've genuinely just been doing this: 7 50 580 Art Masterpieces @artprinteditions.bsky.social · 49m Self-portrait with easel, by Rembrandt, 1660, Louvre  #Rembrandt ALT 7 39 𝔸𝕞𝕓𝕖𝕣 𝔻𝕒𝕨𝕟 @amberdawn1116.bsky.social · 19h I don’t generally approve of graffiti, but… 78 483 3.5K Long_Painter @longpainter.bsky.social · 14h New meat painting 8”x10” oil. Available. 4 17 162 🏰𝕯𝖚𝖓𝖌𝖊𝖔𝖓𝖑𝖚𝖘𝖙🏰 @dungeonlust.com · 11h Art by • Alexey Gorboot 53 264 ProPublica @propublica.org · 1h NEW: Judges in some parts of the country have taken months to adjudicate immigrants’ claims of unlawful imprisonment, our analysis of 70,000 habeas petition cases found. \n\nSome detainees are asking to be deported rather than wait in detention centers. These Judges Take Months to Decide If Immigrants Have Been Unlawfully Detained Judges in some parts of the country have taken months to adjudicate immigrants’ claims of unlawful imprisonment, our analysis of 70,000 habeas petition cases found. Some detainees are asking to be dep... www.propublica.org 21 274 452 Amy Gann @amygann.bsky.social · 6h A grackle stands out against the light colored background.\n\nFor the #birdoftheday theme of #contrast #birds #grackle #protectnature #EastCoastKin ALT 9 13 83 𝙲𝙰𝙿𝙴 𝙲𝙾𝙳 𝙿𝙾𝚂𝚃𝙰𝙰𝙷 @capecodpostaah.bsky.social · 3h Laying in bed listening to the rain outside my window. \n\nVery calming.😌 GIF 32 75 930 Ka'ra the tuxedo cat @karaisntactive.bsky.social · 1h dAde giggles when he sees my naked lip ALT 1 3 79 Eric Orchard @inkybat.bsky.social · 1h Details. Hand is so the inky doesn’t get shiny from window light. Also gives an idea of the scale of the drawing 1 11 172 All Elite Wrestling @allelitewrestling.com · 10h #AEWAllOut 8pm ET/5pm PT on PPV\nSaturday, 9/26\n\nAEW World Title\nWill Ospreay vs Jon Moxley\n\nAEW World Champion Will Ospreay will fight Jon Moxley, the man who helped train Will in his championship journey & someone Ospreay has never beaten, in Chicago on Saturday 9/26 at All Out! 4 27 123 NPR @npr.org · 1h At a time when women were largely limited to domestic roles, Steinem challenged gender stereotypes and championed feminist ideals like equality, sisterhood and reproductive freedom. n.pr/3T6gEma Gloria Steinem, trailblazing journalist and activist, dies at 92 At a time when women were largely limited to domestic roles, Steinem challenged gender stereotypes and championed feminist ideals like equality, sisterhood and reproductive freedom. n.pr 14 133 391 Malky @themalky.bsky.social · 9h Swamp lady ALT 44 1.3K 5.1K Saganism @sagan.bsky.social · 44m “What Orwell feared were those who would ban books. What Huxley feared was that there would be no reason to ban a book, for there would be no one who wanted to read one.”\n\n— Neil Postman ALT 2 25 75 Baseball by BSmile @bsmile.bsky.social · 12m The great Bob Gibson in action! #MLB #Legend #STLCards 3 10 Paul @paulst001.bsky.social · 7h Our latest rose from the garden this morning 3 10 129 I'm Uni :3 @unicouniuni3.bsky.social · 13m I feel like a mama bird 3 82 403 Michelle says: Be kind. Always. ❤️ @snarkysillysad.bsky.social · 52m @dashofsausage (TT) has five dachshunds in maximum cuddle mode: #AGoodPlace 5 39 243 ProPublica @propublica.org · 10h The success of the U.S. vaccination system depends on two fundamental pillars: parents trusting in vaccines and children having access to them.\n\nUnder RFK Jr., both are in peril.\n\n(Published March) How Robert F. Kennedy Jr.’s Vaccine Agenda Risks a Resurgence of Deadly Childhood Plagues The health secretary is spreading doubts about vaccine safety and considering changes that could prompt manufacturers to flee the U.S. market. History has shown how plagues from the past can roar back... www.propublica.org 24 434 884 Gabby @gabbydp.bsky.social · 10h The yellow one thought she was being sneaky, perhaps invisible……who’s gonna tell her.\n\nNot me ALT 2 4 37 Chris Errington @chriserrington1.bsky.social · 1h Owen Oseni is set to return to Argyle's squad for the away League One game against Doncaster on Saturday after missing the first month of the season. #pafc Owen Oseni set to return for Argyle against Doncaster The striker has not played in any of Argyle's first six matches of the season due to a thigh injury www.plymouthherald.co.uk 4 Mother Jones @motherjones.com · 2h Almost as quickly as DHS finalized its contract for new shock gloves, pushback reached the legislative branch in a classic congressional form: a whole bunch of open letters. Lawmakers push DHS to cancel its shock gloves contract \"This administration continues to outfit ICE and CBP with the tools of an occupying paramilitary force.\" www.motherjones.com 10 43 147 The Washington Post @washingtonpost.com · 23h A record number of Americans believe there is widespread corruption in the U.S. government, reaching the highest level of distrust in two decades, according to a new Gallup poll. Poll shows nearly 90% of Americans believe government corruption is widespread Americans have the highest level of distrust in their government in two decades, voicing bipartisan frustration with the country's institutions and the people who run them. www.washingtonpost.com 85 218 394 Create account Sign in Trending 1. AEW Dynamite Live 2. Epstein files court filing 3. Sean Lennon becomes a father 4. Birthright citizenship order case 5. Death of Gloria Steinem Privacy ∙ Terms ∙ Help English JavaScript Required This is a heavily interactive web application, and JavaScript is required. Simple HTML interfaces are possible, but that is not what this is. Learn more about Bluesky at bsky.social and atproto.com ."
